OL,3,GNEWSAGolf course homes plan turned down
OL,4,Aat High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompanies that wanted to add 70 homes
OL,7,Fto a project currently under
OL,8,Fconstruction on a former golf course
OL,9,Fhave seen a bid turned down at the High
OL,10,FCourt.
OL,12,FEmmer Green Drive is a new estate of
OL,13,F223 homes being built by Vistry Thames
OL,14,FValley on the former site of Reading
OL,15,FGolf Club in Caversham, Berkshire.
OL,17,FLandowner Reading Golf Club and land
OL,18,Facquisition company Fairfax (Reading)
OL,19,FLtd submitted plans to South
OL,20,FOxfordshire District Council (SODC) for
OL,21,Fthe additional homes but the authority
OL,22,Frejected them in December.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
