OL,3,GNEWSAGolf course homes plan turned down
OL,4,Aat High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal for them was rejected by the
OL,7,FPlanning Inspectorate in June and on
OL,8,FThursday Judge Sir Peter Lane rejected
OL,9,Fan application for a judicial review.
